Attackers from Europe and South America led the goal charts, but contributions also came from players representing less-heralded nations. These balanced attacking performances highlight the global quality present in the tournament.

## Assist Leaders and Creative Playmakers

Midfield architects and playmakers created opportunities with precise passes and intelligent movement. The assist leaders often combined vision with sharp decision-making, unlocking compact defenses and setting up decisive goals.

Several creative midfielders also showed leadership qualities, controlling tempo and linking defense with attack effectively.

